      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Similar to URL shortening service, but some additional consideration\n-- can limit user paste bigger than 10Mb to stop abuse service\n-- impose size limit on custom URL to have consistent URL database\n-- New Pastes per second: 1M / (24 hours * 3600 seconds) ~= 10 pastes/sec\n-- Paste reads per second: 100M / (24 hours * 3600 seconds) ~= 1200 reads/sec",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
